WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.708
Run the department query and focus first on row
grain Each row

00:00:05.721 --> 00:00:11.656
represents one department The outer aggregate
functions summarize admission

00:00:11.683 --> 00:00:17.371
rows The correlated scalar subquery uses the current
department name

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:23.215
to count open admissions only for that department
This is a useful pattern

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:25.136
for dashboards and grouped summaries
